      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Character Sheet from a description\n\nDesigns a new character from a text description and lays it out as a character sheet: four turnaround views and six expressions, stitched into one image.\n\n**How to use:** in the **Front view** node, replace the text after `Character:` with your own description (who they are, hair, eyes, outfit, colors), then run. Keep the rest of that prompt as it is: it asks for the neutral full-body pose the other panels are built from. Change `polished anime illustration` there to `photorealistic photo` or another style if you want a different look.\n\n**What you get** in `output/character_sheet/`:\n\n- `sheet_*.png`: front, three-quarter, side and back views on top, six expressions below\n- `front_*.png`: the clean front view on its own, a good first frame or reference for image-to-video\n\n**Time:** 10 images per run. The three views run in parallel, then the six expressions run in parallel, so a run usually takes a few minutes.\n\n**Redo one panel:** edit that node's prompt (even one word) and run again. Only the changed panel and the sheet are regenerated; the other panels come from the cache.\n\n**Model:** every node uses `Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo`, which runs about twice as fast as the base model. Switch a node to `Qwen-Image-2.1` to get the `steps` slider.\n\n**One-time setup.** This workflow uses the Video Factory Qwen-Image 2.1 node; if ComfyUI reports it missing, install it from the Manager. Register at https://h3.oneclickamd.ai/?utm_source=comfyui, then save your key to `h3_gateway_api_key.txt` in the ComfyUI user directory. On the Windows Desktop app the file goes in Desktop's install directory, for example `C:\\Users\\<you>\\AppData\\Local\\Comfy-Desktop\\ComfyUI-Installs\\ComfyUI\\ComfyUI\\user\\h3_gateway_api_key.txt`. If the key is missing, the first node fails right away and names the exact file it looked for.\n\n**Your key is not in this workflow**, so the workflow and the images it saves are safe to share.\n\n**From FlowFactory:** more ready-to-run workflows at https://github.com/wangxunx/FlowFactory\n\n---\n\n**中文说明：** 在 Front view 节点里，把 `Character:` 后面的描述换成你的角色（发型、眼睛、服装、配色），直接运行即可。其余文字保持不变，它负责生成后续各格依赖的中性全身站姿；想要写实风格，把 `polished anime illustration` 改成 `photorealistic photo`。输出在 `output/character_sheet/`，每次运行生成 10 张图。\n\n更多开箱即用的工作流见 FlowFactory：https://github.com/wangxunx/FlowFactory"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
