      "widgets_values": [
        "Character: a cheerful anime girl with huge fluffy fennec ears, a big fluffy fox tail, long wavy blonde hair and bright blue eyes, wearing a pink sundress and white sneakers.\n\nCharacter design reference sheet panel: a clean full-body front view of this character, as a polished anime illustration with clean linework and soft cel shading. Standing upright with the body, head and eyes squarely facing the viewer and looking straight ahead, shoulders level, arms relaxed at the sides, toes pointing toward the viewer, feet slightly apart, calm neutral expression. Keep any item the character holds or carries. Show the whole body from head to toes, centered, on a plain pure white background with soft even studio lighting. No text, no background objects, no extra characters.",
        "9:16",
        "Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo"
      ],
      "title": "Front view",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
