      "widgets_values": [
        "Turn the whole character 45 degrees toward the left side of the image, a classic three-quarter view halfway between the front view and a side profile. Head, chest, hips and feet all turn together: the far side of the face is partly hidden behind the nose, the far shoulder and arm are partly hidden behind the body, and the toes point toward the lower left corner of the image. Standing upright with arms relaxed. Keep exactly the same character: same face, hairstyle, ears, outfit, colors, body proportions and art style, and any item the character holds or carries. Whole body visible from head to toes at the same scale, centered, on a plain pure white background with the same soft even lighting. No text.",
